{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/(storefront)/layout,_N_T_/(storefront)/policies/layout,_N_T_/(storefront)/policies/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/(storefront)/policies/[slug]/page,_N_T_/policies/returns"},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/521b714bff6ba97cb3d977772265b1a7f1b35517fd5e312ad82299dfb21f3e17/$/policies/returns","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/(storefront)/policies/[slug]/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--WuYL1yXOKTpKKDryab8Un--><html lang=\"en-IN\" data-theme=\"aurora-indigo\" class=\"__variable_ee8384 __variable_2bc4d6\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/8760c4774489e4ba-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/e4af272ccee01ff0-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/images/plusmark/brand/plusmark.png\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/24d6796379e56dce.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/d86a56b0b1897102.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-325767d0d4e00edf.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-60d8dc7c8c9309a1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-f3336e172256d2ab.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/44530001-608230481555e316.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/6140-e4db21d7c7c3521b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/8249-03e93bf5f9933dcd.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/9630-c1fb395043fc5591.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/9110-25d55e93bfc53bae.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/7424-d71b297952f9b097.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-539a636635f2af99.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/297-f56ae2421d6e7c3e.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5239-9a33e3a80e63e22d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4997-011d73490f990f4d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/(storefront)/layout-77329954772a8c14.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/593-764474491009b5a6.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/(storefront)/policies/%5Bslug%5D/page-133c95fce789f075.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/6794-2016314f9caeb695.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/(storefront)/page-8098c86555ff3bac.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Returns &amp; refunds policy · Plusmark — Writing &amp; Display Systems</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"A draft framework for standard and made-to-order boards. Return eligibility, windows and refund timings await Plusmark’s written approval.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"white boards,chalk boards,notice boards,magnetic boards,ceramic boards,board stands,school benches,Plusmark\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://plusmark-storefront.palhariom698.workers.dev/policies/returns\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Returns &amp; refunds policy · Plusmark — Writing &amp; Display Systems\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A draft framework for standard and made-to-order boards. Return eligibility, windows and refund timings await Plusmark’s written approval.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://plusmark-storefront.palhariom698.workers.dev/policies/returns\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Plusmark\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/drt0rpkn2/image/upload/f_jpg,q_auto,w_1200,h_630,c_fill,g_auto/plusmark/products/metallic-premium-white-board\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Plusmark writing and display boards\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Returns &amp; refunds policy · Plusmark — Writing &amp; Display Systems\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"A draft framework for standard and made-to-order boards. Return eligibility, windows and refund timings await Plusmark’s written approval.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/drt0rpkn2/image/upload/f_jpg,q_auto,w_1200,h_630,c_fill,g_auto/plusmark/products/metallic-premium-white-board\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg?2b37422c91207a04\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" sizes=\"any\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-dvh bg-page text-ink\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:absolute focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-[999] focus:rounded-md focus:bg-primary focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-body-sm focus:text-onprimary\">Skip to content</a><div class=\"flex min-h-dvh flex-col pb-[calc(var(--pm-nav-h)+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] lg:pb-0\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 transition-transform duration-200 lg:translate-y-0\"><div class=\"hidden bg-shell text-shell-on md:block\"><p class=\"pm-shell py-1.5 text-center text-[0.625rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-shell-on/90 sm:py-2 sm:text-[0.6875rem] sm:tracking-[0.14em]\">Discover quality writing &amp; display boards by Plusmark</p></div><div class=\"border-b border-line/80 bg-surface transition-shadow lg:bg-surface/85 lg:backdrop-blur-md\"><div class=\"pm-shell flex h-14 items-center gap-2 max-[359px]:gap-1 lg:h-[4.5rem] lg:gap-7\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" class=\"-ml-2 flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xs text-ink hover:bg-subtle lg:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button><a class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-xs\" aria-label=\"Plusmark home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Plusmark\" width=\"1304\" height=\"262\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-7 w-auto max-[359px]:h-6 lg:h-11\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/plusmark/brand/plusmark.png\"/></a><div class=\"relative min-w-0 hidden min-w-0 flex-1 lg:block\"><form role=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search products\" class=\"relative\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search pointer-events-none absolute left-3.5 top-1/2 size-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" role=\"combobox\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" placeholder=\"Search boards, sizes, series or SKU\" aria-label=\"Search products\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"desktop-search\" aria-autocomplete=\"list\" class=\"h-12 w-full rounded-full border border-line-strong bg-page/55 pl-10 pr-10 text-body-sm text-ink placeholder:text-muted focus:border-line-strong focus:bg-surface focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-0 focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [&amp;::-webkit-search-cancel-button]:hidden\" value=\"\"/></form></div><div class=\"ml-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 max-[359px]:gap-0.5 lg:ml-0 lg:gap-4\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Search products\" class=\"flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-primary-soft hover:text-primary-strong lg:hidden\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></button><a aria-label=\"Account\" class=\"relative flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-3 text-caption font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-primary-soft hover:text-primary-strong lg:h-10 lg:px-2.5 hidden lg:flex\" href=\"/account\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span class=\"hidden xl:block\">Account</span></a><a aria-label=\"Wishlist\" class=\"relative flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-3 text-caption font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-primary-soft hover:text-primary-strong lg:h-10 lg:px-2.5\" href=\"/wishlist\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg><span class=\"hidden xl:block\">Wishlist</span></a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Cart\" class=\"relative flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-3 text-caption font-medium text-ink transition-colors hover:bg-primary-soft hover:text-primary-strong lg:h-10 lg:px-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-cart size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M2.05 2.05h2l2.66 12.42a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.58h9.78a2 2 0 0 0 1.95-1.57l1.65-7.43H5.12\"></path></svg><span class=\"hidden sm:block\">Cart</span></button></div></div><nav aria-label=\"Product navigation\" class=\"hidden border-t border-line lg:block\"><div class=\"pm-shell\"><div class=\"relative flex h-12 items-center gap-1\"><div class=\"relative\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"pm-mega\" class=\"rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-ink\">Shop All Boards</button></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-white-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/white-boards\">White Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-chalk-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/chalk-boards\">Chalk Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-notice-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/notice-boards\">Notice Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-collections-ceramic-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/collections/ceramic-boards\">Ceramic Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-display-boards\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/display-boards\">Display Boards</a></div><div><a aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-menu-shop-board-stands\" class=\"relative block rounded-xs px-3 py-2 text-body-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:text-ink text-muted\" href=\"/shop/board-stands\">Board Stands</a></div></div></div></nav></div></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"bg-page border-b border-line py-10 lg:py-14\"><div class=\"pm-shell flex flex-col gap-6\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 text-caption text-muted\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><a class=\"-my-2.5 inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-xs py-2.5 transition-colors hover:text-ink hover:underline hover:decoration-line-strong hover:underline-offset-4\" href=\"/\">Home</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3 text-hair-strong\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><a class=\"-my-2.5 inline-flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-xs py-2.5 transition-colors hover:text-ink hover:underline hover:decoration-line-strong hover:underline-offset-4\" href=\"/policies\">Policies</a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3 text-hair-strong\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"text-ink\">Returns &amp; refunds policy</span></li></ol></nav><div class=\"grid gap-10\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4\"><h1 class=\"balance max-w-[24ch] font-display font-extrabold text-ink text-h1\">Returns &amp; refunds policy</h1><p class=\"pretty max-w-reading text-body leading-relaxed text-muted\">A draft framework for standard and made-to-order boards. Return eligibility, windows and refund timings await Plusmark’s written approval.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"policy-status\" class=\"scroll-mt-48 lg:scroll-mt-52 py-16 lg:py-24 border-b border-line bg-page\" aria-labelledby=\"policy-status-heading\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-reading px-md sm:px-lg xl:px-2xl\"><header class=\"mb-6 flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between md:gap-8 lg:mb-10\"><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2\"><h2 id=\"policy-status-heading\" class=\"balance max-w-[24ch] font-display font-extrabold text-ink text-h2\">Status of this document</h2></div></header><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border px-4 py-3 border-warning/30 bg-warning-wash text-ink\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-muted\"><span class=\"flex size-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-warning/50 text-[0.625rem] font-semibold text-warning\" aria-hidden=\"true\">!</span></span><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><p class=\"text-body-sm font-semibold\">Draft policy — pending business sign-off</p><div class=\"text-caption leading-relaxed text-muted\"><p>Returns &amp; refunds policy<!-- --> is written for this prototype from the information Plusmark publishes today (catalogue, FAQ and contact details). Freight rules, delivery estimates, return windows and refund timelines have not been signed off by the business, so they are marked <em>to be confirmed</em> rather than guessed. Nothing on this page is a Plusmark commitment, and no certification or warranty period is asserted here.</p><p class=\"pt-1\">Confirm the terms that apply to your order with the Plusmark desk before placing it — see<!-- --> <a class=\"underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-ink\" href=\"/contact\">contact &amp; support</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-hair sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"bg-surface p-5\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-caption font-semibold text-ink\">Stated from published information</p><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Plusmark makes non-standard sizes and layouts to order.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>The order confirmation defines the product, size and quantity.</li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Order-specific questions are handled by the Plusmark support team.</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-subtle/50 p-5\"><p class=\"mb-3 text-caption font-semibold text-muted\">Awaiting business sign-off</p><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-warning\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Return eligibility for standard and custom products</li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-warning\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Return request window and return freight</li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-warning\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Inspection, restocking and deduction rules</li><li class=\"flex gap-2 text-body-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full border border-warning\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Refund method and processing timeline</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8\"><section class=\"border-t border-line pt-8\" aria-labelledby=\"policy-section-1\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-4\"><span class=\"tabular text-caption font-semibold text-muted\">01</span><h2 id=\"policy-section-1\" class=\"font-display text-h2 leading-tight\">Check your order confirmation before paying</h2></div><div class=\"flex max-w-reading flex-col gap-5 [&amp;_a]:text-ink [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-line-strong [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_a]:hover:decoration-primary [&amp;_h2]:pt-3 [&amp;_h2]:font-display [&amp;_h2]:text-h2 [&amp;_h2]:leading-tight [&amp;_h2]:text-ink [&amp;_h3]:font-display [&amp;_h3]:text-h3 [&amp;_h3]:leading-snug [&amp;_h3]:text-ink [&amp;_li]:text-body-sm [&amp;_li]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_li]:text-muted [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-2 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_p]:text-body-sm [&amp;_p]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_p]:text-muted [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-2 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5\"><p>Confirm the series, writing face, size, quantity and any custom layout against the order confirmation. Custom dimensions, line marking and printed schedules are made for the particular requirement; this draft does not presume that they can be returned as ordinary stock.</p><p>No return window is promised by this prototype. The applicable terms must be confirmed with Plusmark before payment.</p><span class=\"my-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-xs border border-dashed border-warning/50 bg-warning-wash px-2 py-1 text-caption font-medium text-warning\">To be confirmed · <!-- -->Standard-product return window</span></span><span class=\"my-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-xs border border-dashed border-warning/50 bg-warning-wash px-2 py-1 text-caption font-medium text-warning\">To be confirmed · <!-- -->Made-to-order cancellation and return rules</span></span></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-line pt-8\" aria-labelledby=\"policy-section-2\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-4\"><span class=\"tabular text-caption font-semibold text-muted\">02</span><h2 id=\"policy-section-2\" class=\"font-display text-h2 leading-tight\">Requesting help with an order</h2></div><div class=\"flex max-w-reading flex-col gap-5 [&amp;_a]:text-ink [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-line-strong [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_a]:hover:decoration-primary [&amp;_h2]:pt-3 [&amp;_h2]:font-display [&amp;_h2]:text-h2 [&amp;_h2]:leading-tight [&amp;_h2]:text-ink [&amp;_h3]:font-display [&amp;_h3]:text-h3 [&amp;_h3]:leading-snug [&amp;_h3]:text-ink [&amp;_li]:text-body-sm [&amp;_li]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_li]:text-muted [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-2 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_p]:text-body-sm [&amp;_p]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_p]:text-muted [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-2 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5\"><p>Use the published phone, email or WhatsApp channel and provide the business order reference, the affected items and a clear description of the issue. A local prototype reference is not a Plusmark order and cannot be used to request a refund.</p><ul><li>Do not discard packaging or documentation until the desk advises you.</li><li>Do not send an item back without a confirmed return instruction and destination.</li><li>Any inspection requirement and freight responsibility must be agreed with the desk.</li></ul><span class=\"my-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-xs border border-dashed border-warning/50 bg-warning-wash px-2 py-1 text-caption font-medium text-warning\">To be confirmed · <!-- -->Evidence and inspection procedure</span></span><span class=\"my-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-xs border border-dashed border-warning/50 bg-warning-wash px-2 py-1 text-caption font-medium text-warning\">To be confirmed · <!-- -->Return freight responsibility</span></span></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-line pt-8\" aria-labelledby=\"policy-section-3\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-baseline gap-4\"><span class=\"tabular text-caption font-semibold text-muted\">03</span><h2 id=\"policy-section-3\" class=\"font-display text-h2 leading-tight\">Refunds</h2></div><div class=\"flex max-w-reading flex-col gap-5 [&amp;_a]:text-ink [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-line-strong [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_a]:hover:decoration-primary [&amp;_h2]:pt-3 [&amp;_h2]:font-display [&amp;_h2]:text-h2 [&amp;_h2]:leading-tight [&amp;_h2]:text-ink [&amp;_h3]:font-display [&amp;_h3]:text-h3 [&amp;_h3]:leading-snug [&amp;_h3]:text-ink [&amp;_li]:text-body-sm [&amp;_li]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_li]:text-muted [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-2 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_p]:text-body-sm [&amp;_p]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_p]:text-muted [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-2 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5\"><p>No refund timeline, deduction schedule or payment-route rule has been signed off. If a refund is approved for a real Plusmark order, its amount, method and timing must be confirmed in writing by the business.</p><span class=\"my-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-xs border border-dashed border-warning/50 bg-warning-wash px-2 py-1 text-caption font-medium text-warning\">To be confirmed · <!-- -->Refund processing timeline</span></spa